[[:db/add "82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4" :answer/id #uuid "82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4"] [:db/add "82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59" :answer-field/id #uuid "1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59"] [:db/add "1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59" :answer-field/choices "82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4"] [:db/add "1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59" :answer-field/correct "82f90b3b-718e-5af0-bd01-71e88494b6b4"] [:db/ensure "1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330" :question/id #uuid "5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330"] [:db/add "5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{12}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} 4 \\cot{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{12}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{12}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} 4 \\cot{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\csc{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}=2,\\quad \\csc{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=1$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- 2 \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=\\left(-2\\right)-\\left(-4\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n2.\n$$"] [:db/add "5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330" :question/answer-fields "1d79769f-4b26-543f-825e-ac05959c0c59"] [:db/ensure "5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "5706e08a-8a9b-5357-a5fc-b39f755d0330"] [:db/add "8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2" :answer/id #uuid "8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2"] [:db/add "8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}"] [:db/ensure "8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f" :answer-field/id #uuid "d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f"] [:db/add "d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f" :answer-field/choices "8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2"] [:db/add "d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f" :answer-field/correct "8ffaa96d-b049-5220-bf5a-07c7510e2ad2"] [:db/ensure "d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3" :question/id #uuid "7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3"] [:db/add "7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{8}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} 3 \\csc^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{8}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} 3 \\csc^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\cot{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}=1,\\quad \\cot{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=0$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{3 \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=\\left(0\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{3}{2}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3" :question/answer-fields "d6bd7d1f-4f6f-536e-8b4f-280c1f7c4a2f"] [:db/ensure "7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "7f5d3baa-87aa-5907-affa-f2b28b4b2bc3"] [:db/add "afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6" :answer/id #uuid "afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6"] [:db/add "afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6" :answer/value "\\frac{3 \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd" :answer-field/id #uuid "47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd"] [:db/add "47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd" :answer-field/choices "afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6"] [:db/add "47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd" :answer-field/correct "afbe65c0-9465-568c-bb98-33b813e778f6"] [:db/ensure "47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5" :question/id #uuid "f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5"] [:db/add "f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 3 \\tan{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 \\tan{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{3 \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3 \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5" :question/answer-fields "47766019-c186-5964-863f-d273f2d556bd"] [:db/ensure "f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "f9ef0223-5ac0-581e-a037-c22f02804cd5"] [:db/add "c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e" :answer/id #uuid "c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e"] [:db/add "c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e" :answer/value "- \\csc{\\left(2 x + 3 \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce" :answer-field/id #uuid "64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce"] [:db/add "64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce" :answer-field/choices "c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e"] [:db/add "64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce" :answer-field/correct "c7f282fa-3af4-57f8-9f1b-3c38d421db7e"] [:db/ensure "64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2" :question/id #uuid "22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2"] [:db/add "22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2 \\cot{\\left(2 x + 3 \\right)} \\csc{\\left(2 x + 3 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x + 3$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 \\cot{\\left(2 x + 3 \\right)} \\csc{\\left(2 x + 3 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\csc{\\left(2 x + 3 \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2" :question/answer-fields "64b21847-de61-5f47-9784-44557ad21bce"] [:db/ensure "22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "22a670a8-8ccd-5a69-88a2-ddfa4fbd44e2"] [:db/add "1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb" :answer/id #uuid "1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb"] [:db/add "1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a" :answer-field/id #uuid "c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a"] [:db/add "c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a" :answer-field/choices "1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb"] [:db/add "c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a" :answer-field/correct "1c614efa-de4c-5267-b5ab-171c6a4990fb"] [:db/ensure "c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782" :question/id #uuid "e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782"] [:db/add "e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{8}}^{0} 4 \\sec^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=- \\frac{\\pi}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{8}}^{0} 4 \\sec^{2}{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int_{- \\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{0} \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\tan{\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}=-1,\\quad \\tan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[2 \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{- \\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{0}=\\left(0\\right)-\\left(-2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n2.\n$$"] [:db/add "e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782" :question/answer-fields "c8e483e2-b82a-5637-b7f0-934231925d4a"] [:db/ensure "e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "e1c02b6f-9b28-5b6e-9b46-7cfdd9245782"] [:db/add "78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2" :answer/id #uuid "78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2"] [:db/add "78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2" :answer/value "- \\frac{4 \\cot{\\left(3 x + 3 \\right)}}{3}"] [:db/ensure "78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337" :answer-field/id #uuid "bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337"] [:db/add "bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337" :answer-field/choices "78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2"] [:db/add "bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337" :answer-field/correct "78d03258-3a91-5590-b9b2-678f9b0460f2"] [:db/ensure "bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c" :question/id #uuid "4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c"] [:db/add "4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 4 \\csc^{2}{\\left(3 x + 3 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x + 3$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 4 \\csc^{2}{\\left(3 x + 3 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\frac{4 \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{4 \\cot{\\left(3 x + 3 \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c" :question/answer-fields "bc0e3fba-d493-5233-ad84-cc68f3ace337"] [:db/ensure "4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "4b79bc43-a386-5a26-8d0e-8a9d180ffc6c"] [:db/add "0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310" :answer/id #uuid "0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310"] [:db/add "0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310" :answer/value "\\tan{\\left(4 x + 3 \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310" :answer/validate] [:db/add "6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c" :answer-field/id #uuid "6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c"] [:db/add "6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c" :answer-field/choices "0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310"] [:db/add "6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c" :answer-field/correct "0bad114b-1889-54b2-963c-21d34b442310"] [:db/ensure "6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef" :question/id #uuid "20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef"] [:db/add "20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 4 \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x + 3 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x + 3$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=4.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 4 \\sec^{2}{\\left(4 x + 3 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\tan{\\left(4 x + 3 \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef" :question/answer-fields "6f387387-e157-5ce0-aac4-3ac0638dc59c"] [:db/ensure "20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "20dc1f0e-e8bc-5bb4-b605-c55b3ca0b2ef"] [:db/add "ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd" :answer/id #uuid "ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd"] [:db/add "ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69" :answer-field/id #uuid "0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69"] [:db/add "0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69" :answer-field/choices "ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd"] [:db/add "0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69" :answer-field/correct "ad9ab779-9062-5775-b5ef-1da33e9f58dd"] [:db/ensure "0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda" :question/id #uuid "fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda"] [:db/add "fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} 4 \\tan{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} 4 \\tan{\\left(2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=2\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\sec{\\left(0 \\right)}=1,\\quad \\sec{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3} \\right)}=2$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[2 \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}=\\left(4\\right)-\\left(2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n2.\n$$"] [:db/add "fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda" :question/answer-fields "0b336269-20d1-5e77-b894-50bc84329d69"] [:db/ensure "fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "fb55166d-e7d5-5d79-9dfc-21d2e9f48bda"] [:db/add "3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140" :answer/id #uuid "3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140"] [:db/add "3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140" :answer/validate] [:db/add "48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d" :answer-field/id #uuid "48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d"] [:db/add "48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d" :answer-field/choices "3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140"] [:db/add "48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d" :answer-field/correct "3a7a0047-e8d9-5409-8a8e-3017dc890140"] [:db/ensure "48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d" :question/id #uuid "251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d"] [:db/add "251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} 2 \\sec^{2}{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{4}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{\\pi}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} 2 \\sec^{2}{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{- \\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\tan{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}=1,\\quad \\tan{\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}=-1$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{- \\frac{\\pi}{4}}=\\left(1\\right)-\\left(-1\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n2.\n$$"] [:db/add "251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d" :question/answer-fields "48cffb4d-241c-523a-8c45-cbbf1b28ed1d"] [:db/ensure "251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "251d2494-5d7a-591d-8549-96f9e9775e7d"] [:db/add "71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a" :answer/id #uuid "71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a"] [:db/add "71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a" :answer/value "\\frac{\\csc{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)}}{2}"] [:db/ensure "71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a" :answer/validate] [:db/add "cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5" :answer-field/id #uuid "cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5"] [:db/add "cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5" :answer-field/choices "71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a"] [:db/add "cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5" :answer-field/correct "71dbf5b6-6c1e-53bf-94fb-02d1005d0f4a"] [:db/ensure "cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497" :question/id #uuid "42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497"] [:db/add "42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2 \\cot{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 - 4 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 \\cot{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)} \\csc{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{\\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\csc{\\left(3 - 4 x \\right)}}{2}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497" :question/answer-fields "cee9c62d-2de5-534d-91ae-05bf9c2f6bb5"] [:db/ensure "42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "42da2a93-0d62-534c-a027-05da7f30d497"] [:db/add "cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68" :answer/id #uuid "cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68"] [:db/add "cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}"] [:db/ensure "cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581" :answer-field/id #uuid "d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581"] [:db/add "d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581" :answer-field/choices "cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68"] [:db/add "d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581" :answer-field/correct "cef0d8a8-fe8f-5015-b7e2-cc307e60aa68"] [:db/ensure "d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979" :question/id #uuid "a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979"] [:db/add "a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} \\cot{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} \\cot{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)} \\csc{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\cot{\\left(u \\right)} \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\csc{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\csc{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=1,\\quad \\csc{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6} \\right)}=2$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{\\csc{\\left(u \\right)}}{2}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}}=\\left(1\\right)-\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979" :question/answer-fields "d084e1ed-d542-54ac-8e98-d5a3a1b53581"] [:db/ensure "a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "a9bd005b-6418-57af-a882-7141e88f9979"] [:db/add "7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8" :answer/id #uuid "7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8"] [:db/add "7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8" :answer/value "2"] [:db/ensure "7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8" :answer/validate] [:db/add "81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda" :answer-field/id #uuid "81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda"] [:db/add "81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda" :answer-field/choices "7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8"] [:db/add "81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda" :answer-field/correct "7494b79b-f526-5462-b61d-4250336140e8"] [:db/ensure "81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0" :question/id #uuid "faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0"] [:db/add "faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{8}} 4 \\csc^{2}{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{8}} 4 \\csc^{2}{\\left(- 2 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-2\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\cot{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=0,\\quad \\cot{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4} \\right)}=1$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[2 \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}=\\left(2\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n2.\n$$"] [:db/add "faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0" :question/answer-fields "81c4cf15-4b50-5284-8986-63a961b5ceda"] [:db/ensure "faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "faef1f10-e898-55db-9c5f-90f5c88abaa0"] [:db/add "6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701" :answer/id #uuid "6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701"] [:db/add "6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701" :answer/value "\\cot{\\left(2 - 2 x \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701" :answer/validate] [:db/add "555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052" :answer-field/id #uuid "555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052"] [:db/add "555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052" :answer-field/choices "6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701"] [:db/add "555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052" :answer-field/correct "6cf98e0e-42d1-5397-a244-674fd4944701"] [:db/ensure "555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a" :question/id #uuid "c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a"] [:db/add "c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 2 \\csc^{2}{\\left(2 - 2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 - 2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 2 \\csc^{2}{\\left(2 - 2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-\\left(\\int \\csc^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\cot{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\cot{\\left(2 - 2 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a" :question/answer-fields "555a06df-3e05-59c9-98a2-f1c42bd7e052"] [:db/ensure "c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "c06358ca-e05b-557c-8e09-11accb28a69a"] [:db/add "7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516" :answer/id #uuid "7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516"] [:db/add "7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516" :answer/value "- \\tan{\\left(3 - 3 x \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977" :answer-field/id #uuid "c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977"] [:db/add "c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977" :answer-field/choices "7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516"] [:db/add "c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977" :answer-field/correct "7edc0bcb-01a7-5e8b-a229-d98d5a6e1516"] [:db/ensure "c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74" :question/id #uuid "9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74"] [:db/add "9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 3 \\sec^{2}{\\left(3 - 3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 - 3 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 \\sec^{2}{\\left(3 - 3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-\\left(\\int \\sec^{2}{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\tan{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\tan{\\left(3 - 3 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74" :question/answer-fields "c065add8-9e7a-5b42-b399-1422ec370977"] [:db/ensure "9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "9da769f3-a849-5259-bfd9-980742827c74"] [:db/add "9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1" :answer/id #uuid "9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1"] [:db/add "9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1" :answer/value "-1"] [:db/ensure "9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149" :answer-field/id #uuid "4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149"] [:db/add "4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149" :answer-field/choices "9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1"] [:db/add "4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149" :answer-field/correct "9822942d-ee3d-5e51-9947-44041aa709b1"] [:db/ensure "4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894" :question/id #uuid "1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894"] [:db/add "1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} 2 \\tan{\\left(- 2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(- 2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 2 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-2.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=- \\frac{\\pi}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} 2 \\tan{\\left(- 2 x \\right)} \\sec{\\left(- 2 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\left(\\int_{0}^{- \\frac{\\pi}{3}} \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the integration rule:\n\n$$\n\\int \\tan{\\left(u \\right)} \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sec{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nEndpoint values: $\\sec{\\left(0 \\right)}=1,\\quad \\sec{\\left(- \\frac{\\pi}{3} \\right)}=2$.\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\sec{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{- \\frac{\\pi}{3}}=\\left(-2\\right)-\\left(-1\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n-1.\n$$"] [:db/add "1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894" :question/answer-fields "4b1fe238-c7d7-56ac-ab2e-75e8279b1149"] [:db/ensure "1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068916 :knowledge-point/questions "1e2cd692-69ab-514c-9499-935f1583e894"] [:db/add "1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b" :answer/id #uuid "1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b"] [:db/add "1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1f87179b-cacc-5711-b0a8-1f1248c0995b" :answer/value "- \\